# steps/table-receiver.md §8-9: a part of the program whose root declares a field (harness Parts): the
# part's root is not built as a Structure of its own yet -- its fields with their initializers, the
# procedure of its statements, the lexical parent of its methods -- so the field is refused in the words of
# that missing mechanism, where it stands.
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
